# Constraints stack, set-intersection: the unique line takes a kind word. id is unique nat
# (injectivity ∩ ℕ), slot is unique int (negative keys live). The mint respects any
# carrier — 1+max clears the maximum — which is why range alone refuses to stack on unique.
n 2
unique id nat 3 5
unique slot int -5 -3
col grunt bool 1 0
